   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>Use graphing technology to determine the number of solutions for the equation <span data-math=\"(x-4)(x+5)=−20\">(x-4)(x+5)=−20</span>. Then find any solutions.</li>\n</ol>",
